open missing, no create: axqIoFailed: no database file at that path while axqOpen
open with no cache: axqMisuse: the page cache needs at least one page while axqOpen
open a text file: axqNotADatabase: the file isn't an AXQLite database while axqOpen
create: ok 0
insert: ok 2
close: ok 0
